{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_aroma_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_aroma_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"入職邀請","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aroma_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f4326c78891882b0a2c54df5d6b7784034f491859abccb25aa1491fd97e44081","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"阿羅瑪收到了羅德島多個部門的入職邀請。此前，在日復一日的工作中她發現了羅德島的潛藏危機，而這與她的選擇有關。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿羅瑪小姐，這是您試用期考核通過的通知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考核評估科提供的人事任用申請記錄顯示，基於您在試用期的優異表現，有其他部門向您發起了邀請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，要加入哪個部門，選擇權還是在您手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，最後的期限是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要在本週結束前告訴我您的決定就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事部幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望您慎重做出選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會好好考慮的，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"橡皮，怎麼回事啊，洗衣間又要維修？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思！洗衣機出了點故障，很抱歉造成大家的困擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後勤部會聯合工程部一起盡快維修，洗衣間再次開放的時間，我們將另行通知！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我都排了這麼久的隊了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，這也是沒辦法的事，我們就先回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我們會盡快……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經這個時候了，阿羅瑪怎麼還沒來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有她來幫忙清洗這些衣服，我可真不知道該怎麼辦了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不過，如果阿羅瑪知道有這麼多加急的洗衣預約單等著她，一定會頭痛吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，正事要緊，還是先去宿舍找她吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感覺水溫怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再熱一點也沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"力度如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……滿好的，很舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以再往上面一點嗎？對，請幫我抓一下這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的，刷頭會保持在這個位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果有任何不舒服的地方，可以隨時叫我哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿羅瑪，這台尾巴美容水療儀不錯吧？這可是工程部研發的最新產品哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得很有幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，體驗這台水療儀就是今天課程講座的全部嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"體驗很重要啊。既然產品要為人服務，那麼了解使用者體驗當然是非常重要的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這只是課程的一部分啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿羅瑪，你在後勤部每天都那麼忙，一定很辛苦吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使在課程結束後，只要你有空，隨時可以來放鬆放鬆哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？真的可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就趁午休多待一下吧，下午還有好多事要做呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎，如果能多提一些建議就更好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了為大家提供更好的美容造型服務，這都是工程部必要的研究工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我記得化妝和美容造型，應該都屬於後勤部的工作範疇吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當羅比菈塔小姐當初正式入職羅德島時，為什麼會選擇加入工程部呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿羅瑪——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也不在宿舍……奇怪，她到底去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？桌上有一本《毛髮護理與保養技術》……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"批註筆記做得好詳細，原來阿羅瑪最近在學習這些知識……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，有東西從書裡掉出來了……這是工程部的課程講座通知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，工程部？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得阿羅瑪的試用期就快要結束了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該不會……阿羅瑪她不想留在後勤部了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"橡皮前輩，請問小阿羅瑪在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是清流啊，什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天大浴場要做例行清潔，我來問問小阿羅瑪有沒有空！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大浴場？為什麼要阿羅瑪去？大浴場應該要有別的清潔負責人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？其實、其實就是我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，不只是大浴場，現在本艦各區域的清潔工作，都搶著要阿羅瑪去幫忙？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不只要幫廚房處理烹飪失誤後炸得滿牆都是的油污，還要幫訓練場清理那些被打得稀碎的木樁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就連療養庭院的蟲箱她也會幫忙清洗？她明明最怕那些飛蟲的呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼算下來，阿羅瑪的工作量也太超額了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，可是小阿羅瑪每次看上去都很輕鬆呀。有她在，效率能提高很多呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，回想起來每次洗衣間閉門維修時，我也只會想著先去找阿羅瑪來幫忙處理那些堆積如山的衣物……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，明明阿羅瑪早就成為後勤部的中堅力量了，可我們還沒有和她正式聊過入職的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她懂的很多，學什麼都快，做事又認真仔細……工程部想讓她加入也不是不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"橡皮前輩，這是什麼意思……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我要把那些加急洗衣預約單分出去，不能再給阿羅瑪這麼多負擔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後勤部不能沒有阿羅瑪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅比菈塔小姐……你是說，你選擇加入工程部，是因為科技可以幫助其他人，讓他們的工作事半功倍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對呀，畢竟我們每個人的力量都是有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便我提起百倍精神，也不可能在一天之內為所有幹員都做好新造型吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同樣的，阿羅瑪你也不可能在一天之內，為整個羅德島做好清潔吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有了全自動造型儀，或是什麼全自動清潔機，大家的工作都會輕鬆很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也會有更多幹員能及時享受到服務，不是嗎？“在一天之內”，也並非完全不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要為更多幹員提供方便快速的服務，這就是我的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確如此……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅比菈塔小姐，這些自動化機械，最終會取代人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？為什麼這麼問……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是忽然覺得，有些日復一日重複的工作，如果換作是機械來做，可能會比我做得更好吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這樣的哦，阿羅瑪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然經過一次次的迭代，機械確實在不斷替代人來工作，但我認為，人和機械還是各有優勢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“有些事情，只有人知道為什麼需要去做。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的祖母好像說過類似的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，回想起來，敘拉古人好像確實都更相信人的手藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家族需要的往往是一個聽話的洗車工，而不是一套冰冷的全自動洗車設備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺有點懷念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，羅比菈塔小姐好像也是在敘拉古出生的吧？我們算是同鄉呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我很小就離開那裡了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一樣，很久沒回去過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽那些從敘拉古來的幹員說，現在的敘拉古已經在改變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，阿羅瑪想要回去看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是終端上的新訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是一條日程變更的通知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有點奇怪，我下午的工作都取消了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是放假了……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問問橡皮吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼在佔線……算了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你還有時間，要不要再試試別的產品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水療儀的自動工作模式也快結束了，我這裡還有新研發的睡眠上妝機和超音波淨牙器……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，已經可以了，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我還有別的事情想請教羅比菈塔小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請看看這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……一份工程設計申請？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，各區域的清潔工作已經重新分配完了。原本需要阿羅瑪做的那部分，我和清流會幫她分擔一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但真沒想到阿羅瑪還有這麼多清潔以外的工作啊，不僅要去餐廳做什麼食補菜餚，還要在走廊安裝防靜電設備……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，反正都先幫她取消掉了，之後再托別的後勤幹員去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來才是一場硬仗啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，請問阿羅瑪在裡面嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不久前她帶著工程設計圖去找羅比菈塔小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工程設計圖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她拜託溫蒂小姐教她畫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近常看到阿羅瑪拿著各式各樣的資料來，又抱著一大疊圖紙離開……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"資料……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想起來了，之前阿羅瑪也找我要過洗衣間的各種數據資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現有的管道口徑……排水口的最大瞬時通量……還有什麼週期內的用水量……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，我這兩天一直在為維修的事心煩，卻把這個事給忘了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等……現在的阿羅瑪，已經跟工程部的元老溫蒂小姐關係這麼好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一向忙碌的溫蒂小姐都如此重視阿羅瑪的請求，反倒是我……不僅忽視了阿羅瑪的付出，還把她難得主動的請求當作耳邊風了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪她沒跟我提起正式入職之後的事，原來是木已成舟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太晚了，一切都太晚了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我都明白了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尊重阿羅瑪的選擇，不過，至少讓我幫她做最後一件事吧，也不枉我們在後勤部一同奮戰了這麼久……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……一份工程設計申請？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，怎麼還有這台水療儀的早期設計圖？！上面還有我隨手記下的雜誌社電話號碼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，其實是我在溫蒂小姐那裡看到的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正是從她那裡聽說了水療儀的事，才慕名而來的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請看看後面夾著的那些文件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是不同種族幹員毛髮狀況的調查報告，內容很詳盡欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是你自己調查的嗎？好厲害……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了大家的幫忙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅比菈塔小姐，請看看文件中水療儀升級改造的設計是否具有可行性吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，設計申請我看過了，針對不同種族的毛髮特質做差異化改造倒是沒問題啦。但這款水療儀還在測試階段，沒通過最終驗收呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改良之後能否正式量產、能否在洗衣間和大浴場裡大量加裝，還得看可露希爾批不批准呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個不用擔心，大浴場有加裝新設備的空間，我已經跟溫蒂小姐確認過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"產品的性能之後我會配合你繼續測試的，也有很多幹員願意成為體驗測試版加強型水療儀的自願者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可是，為什麼這麼突然？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這原本只是我興趣使然為體驗課設計的一款美容儀器，怎麼突然變得至關重要起來了……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿羅瑪，這到底是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，羅德島正在經歷一場掉毛危機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等……清流小姐，你們在運什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不記得有在今天的廢棄物運出申請單上看到類似的東西……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？我申報過了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些是幹員們的毛髮，都是從本艦各處清理出來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你是說，這座“小山丘”，是由幹員們的毛髮組成的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！小阿羅瑪剛來不久，還不了解情況吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅德島生活的人很多很多的，每天都會掉很多毛髮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清流","speakerId":"avg_385_finlpp_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不及時把這些清理出去，無論是水管啊還是通風管啊，很快就會被它們佔領的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這也太誇張了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，行不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾條管道經過了羅德島的能源動力區，不是說重新設計就能重新設計的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮從別的地方著手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"例如……怎麼了？為什麼一直盯著我看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……溫蒂小姐，你剛才去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我剛從餐廳回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人是不是很多，得很辛苦才能從人堆裡擠出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先別動，你的肩膀沾了好多毛，看起來像是別人尾巴上的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我都拿掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂小姐，妳的臉色好像不太好看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎哎，你別拿消毒噴槍對著我啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！阿羅瑪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了……我知道了，我會來洗這些衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這已經是這個月的第三次了吧……洗衣間總是閉門維修也不是辦法啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，工程部有沒有說到底是什麼原因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來有點好笑……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實……是因為洗衣機的下水管被各式各樣的毛髮堵住了，每一台洗衣機都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再去工程部問問有沒有可行的下水道改造方案吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在徹底修好之前，我們每次開啟洗衣機前都要記得先清理一遍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此……這可是個大麻煩喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，想要徹底解決這場危機是不切實際的。但我還是想知道，有沒有辦法能讓每天清掃出來的毛髮少一​點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，抱著這樣的疑問，每天工作時，我會觀察在各個區域工作的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我發現，有些人只是拉緊拉鍊，都會夾落一些毛髮。還有一些人，每天都要小心地把尾巴從褲子裡揪出來，再仔細地將毛髮梳理整齊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是尾巴上的毛髮，還有頭上的、耳朵上的、脖子後面的……就這樣落在衣服和褲子上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除此之外，有些幹員會在洗衣服之前，先用黏毛器清理一次上面的毛髮。若注意到我在看，他們還會尷尬地笑笑……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後我才了解到，其實在危機背後，更重要的真相是──有很多幹員一直有著掉毛的煩惱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們每天都在打掃那些毛髮，但卻從未嘗試過去解決他們的煩惱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……想為他們做點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你才想要改良推廣這台水療儀……不過，光有這台水療儀，恐怕也不太夠吧。我們還需要更多手段，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"餐廳上架了幾道有著毛髮養護功效的食補菜餚，之後還會有更多品類供大家享用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後勤部提供給大家的洗護用品，除了通用款外，也會增加適應不同種族毛髮質地的新款式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，原本我下午的工作是去儲藏室清點那些防靜電設備……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好了，阿羅瑪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真棒，我已經明白你的堅持了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得剛才我們談論的那個話題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像在化妝時，我總要先找出那些不同的臉孔上最值得修飾的地方。這才是最關鍵的一步呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後是交給全自動造型儀去做，還是找一把稱手的化妝刷，那就看情況了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，阿羅瑪，你不就是這麼做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我也不知道是不是這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能我想得還更簡單……我只是想幫大家解決一些小困擾，為大家帶來更好的生活體驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得，這就是身為羅德島幹員該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……多虧了你，我又有了一些新的設計靈感，你覺得為水療儀添加一個毛髮染色模組如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的調查報告裡也提到了，有很多幹員對自己的毛色不太滿意……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總而言之，我很高興工程部能有你這樣的新助力。怪不得溫蒂她那麼關照你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？工程部的新助力？……我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿羅瑪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"橡皮？你怎麼來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這這這些是洗衣間的各種監測數據，還有結構圖和詳細的人員使用統計情況我也找來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉我之前忙忘了！希望沒有耽誤到你在工程部的研究進度！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢好……可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在後勤部的所有工作，我都安排給其他後勤幹員囉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所有工作？欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得我下午的工作行程都空了……可是，為什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，今晚我們打算在餐廳辦一場慶祝會，來慶祝你順利通過入職考核，正式加入工程部！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你和羅比菈塔小姐忙完，記得去哦，一定不會讓你失望的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這裡面是不是有什麼誤會？我沒有加入工程部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮&羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從下週開始，我就成為後勤部的正式幹員了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，你選擇了我們後勤部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不是在參加羅比菈塔小姐的課程講座嗎？還有這些工程設計圖……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那其實也是為了後勤部的工作……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……不是有其他部門邀請你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……其實只有採購部啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是因為我家人給羅德島寄了太多工坊製作的洗護香氛，才讓採購部以為我有什麼特殊的進貨管道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前沒有接觸過工程學，比不上工程部的那些專業出身的幹員們呀……我知道自己並不適合工程部的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係哦，阿羅瑪。即便我們不在一個部門，也歡迎你隨時來找我溝通學習。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，請一定要來找我。我忽然覺得，好像有種唇彩很適合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總而言之，這也是我的研究工作呀……咳咳，考慮一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，原來都是我搞錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了……差點沒辦法和部門負責人交代……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你怎麼這就要走了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡皮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要告訴後勤部的大家這個好消息！希望還來得及把慶祝橫幅上的“工程部”改成“後勤部”！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，仔細想想還是有點可惜呀，我以為會多一個可靠的後輩呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是我沒說清楚，對不起，羅比菈塔小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事啦，你不用緊張，改造水療機的事就交給我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，這也是為了羅德島的大家嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，剛才你問我想不想回敘拉古，回到我家鄉的那座城鎮。我想……等最近的工作都忙完了，有了休假時間，我就會回去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一些我曾經無法越過的，如今應當能夠越過了吧。我相信敘拉古也會是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅比菈塔","speakerId":"avg_484_robrta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，說不定到時候我們可以同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿羅瑪","speakerId":"avg_446_aroma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
